{
  "type": "excalidraw",
  "version": 2,
  "source": "mcp-excalidraw-server",
  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "s_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 30,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "The gate is not the trigger",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_sub",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 68,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Four conditions, in this order. The VPOC opens the gate; the DOM is deliberately the last thing he looks at.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_r1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_h1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 166,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "1 · THE GATE — where is the period VPOC?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_x1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 194,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Has it flipped? Is it at an extreme, and which one? This is context, read on the\nchart. \"at this point there's no reason for me to have my eyes on the dom.\"",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_r2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_h2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 296,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "2 · A ZONE — has price arrived somewhere real?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_x2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 324,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "A high volume edge, an LVN, the overnight low. An open gate in empty space\nis worth nothing.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_r3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_h3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 426,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "3 · A FINISHED-LOOKING PROFILE",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_x3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 454,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "An exhaustive node, a parabolic taper — something that says the selling (or\nbuying) that made the flip is spent, not still in progress.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_r4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_h4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 556,
      "strokeColor": "#1864ab",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "4 · THE TRIGGER, ON THE DOM — LAST",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_x4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 584,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "Your opponent gives way — the offer stops refreshing, turns blue, pulls off\nthe level. \"the very last thing I want to look at is the execution sequence.\"",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_e",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 670,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 70,
      "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_et",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 690,
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "ENTRY   —   \"But when they do begin to line up, that's when\nI want to lean in.\"   (04-30 @35:49)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_n1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_nt1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 168,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "if this is missing\n\"leave pock there — I will wait for that value and pock shift\nin order to be able to consider any type of counter.\" (07-17\n@25:41)   Want the trade anyway? Size down (04-30 @35:14).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_n2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_nt2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 298,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "if this is missing\n\"you don't want it to be in the middle of nowhere. You want\nto be able to gauge the hand of participation around a zone\nof interest.\"   (04-30 @37:42)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_n3",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 410,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.466Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_nt3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 428,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "if this is missing\n\"if we're building volume, she ain't done.\" (07-17 @26:18)\nOn 07-17 the POC had already flipped down and he was still\nnot long — it only \"invites the opportunity\" (@07:16).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.467Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.467Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_n4",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 110,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 0,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.467Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.467Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s_nt4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 668,
      "y": 558,
      "strokeColor": "#a61e4d",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "if this is missing\n\"we were pressing POC to the low on A period, but nobody\nwas giving up from the offer... no reason to get in on.\nThere's no response.\"  (04-30 @37:14) — gate open, no trade.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.467Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-29T05:49:14.467Z",
      "version": 1
